    [['This must be their true form...', 3], ['The yellow is the foundation, the red is the power, and the green is the head.', 10], ['This is what the slimes are trying to form, and it is formidable. Utilizing the most powerful aspects of each of their components, this foe is dangerous.', 25], ['The green serves as the initial power, the red gathers up any lost health, the yellow uses that health for a very strong attack.', 40], ['I would love to see one of these form. It must be a complex biological reaction to create something so much more powerful than any of them individually, and I wish I could study it, but these creatures are rare.', 65], ['I assume most individual slimes never get the chance to combine into an amalgam. The greens often stay underground, the yellows are very content to never move from their spot, so the reds are the only members of the family that move, making all three happening upon each other an extremely rare occurance.', 100]],
