    //Printentacle:
    [['This is a creature that could only come from this land.', 3], ['The Printentacle is a sentient printer that uses paper to attack its prey. Well... I say "sentient printer" but this creature is purely biological. No part of it is a machine, which makes it even more mysterious.', 8], ['How does it produce the paper? What are the markings on the front of its head for if not for ink?', 15], ['The Printentacle also makes it very hard for me to study it. If I am noticed from a distance, it immediately begins shooting its paper at me. And if I were to get even closer to it, the tentacles would strangle me very quickly.', 25], ['An unfortunate Adder showed me how powerful those tentacles are, although this did lead to an interesting insight into this creature.', 45], ['Outside of the strange printer components of it, the rest of the creature is similar in structure to a squid or an octopus. At the center of the mass of tentacles they actually have what I think is a beak which serves as their mouth.', 70], ["As I am writing this, I just had a disturbing thought. If they eat through the beak between the tentacles and the shoot paper as their form of attack, does this mean that the paper is actually... never mind. I don't really want to think about that. I've been hit by too many pieces of paper to consider that.", 100]],
