    [['Very rarely on my journeys, I can see a pyramid-like structure in the distance.', 2], ['The first one gave me hope that I would be able to learn more about the civilazation that used to live here. Unfortunately that hope was shortlived.', 5], ['Unlike the pyramids back in the real world, these are not simply ceremonial structures, they are more like a highly developed sentry turret.', 10], ['While making my way towards the structure, several blue gems adorning it started to glow and the peak of the structure rose into the air, revealing the biggest gemstone I have ever seen.', 18], ["I was frozen in awe by this point, and I didn't notice the aggresive beeping that was coming from the eye (?) of the structure. I was soon ripped from this trance when the eye slowly turned red and proceeded to launch AN ENORMOUS FREAKING LASER BEAM AT ME!", 32], ["I have obviously not been able to study this mechanism at all. I can't even say whether it's alive or not. All I can say is that I assume it was made by the same people that made the golems, but why didn't they use some of these gems for the golems? They seemingly provide a lot of power, and the gems along the base of the structure seem decorationalso they must have had some to spare...", 50]],
